                "description": "NEW from Emtek Select, the Straight Knurled Conical Knob with Square Rose has a wonderfully modern style that is refreshing and alluring in its design. The Conical Straight Knurled Knob with Square Rose is available in a wide selection of finish options. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Conical Straight Knurled Knob with Square Rose will fit most pre-drilled doors.",
